{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20982","headline":"铜驼悲 · 李贺","name":"铜驼悲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落魄三月罢，寻花去东家。\n谁作送春曲，洛岸悲铜驼。\n桥南多马客，北山饶古人。\n客饮盃中酒，驼悲千万春。\n生世莫徒劳，风吹盘上烛。\n厌见桃株笑，铜驼夜来哭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}